{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065021/block/singleImage/3274237/df/01M80SKPX3Z3GP9F5K38NVVRK3.jpg?updatedAt=1795323297\"/><figcaption>事主當場證實不治。</figcaption></figure><p>今日(22日)上午9時20分，警方接獲一名男子報案，指其母親在吐露港公路近白石角蹈海輕生。救援人員接報到場，將72歲女事主救起，惟當場證實死亡。</p><p>警方以帳篷遮蔽遺體，並調查事件。有女死者親屬到場認屍，有家屬傷心激動。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T05:54:37.840360+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T04:54:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T23:57:32.905242+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T05:48:06.305707+00:00","content_hash":"51e98bcfe505f6d1641fa4ad79464a055b7a9195a453c408b8daf309495b3587","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T05:54:37.840360+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}